  <constraints>
    <constraint source="spec / FR-03, FR-02">Tests MUST assert the interior-edit anchor correctness `(paraId, runIndex, offset)`, atom non-editability + order preservation, and rebasing correctness (incl. concurrent-edit + deleted-content cases). Scope: the two new test files.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038 / NFR-06">Behavior tests of real ProseMirror transactions only. MUST NOT use `Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`, DI-registration, or ctor-null tests. Scope: this task's tests.</constraint>
